2
00:03:24,900 --> 00:03:26,500
レックウザ生存確認！
Rayquaza vitals confirmed!

3
00:03:26,700 --> 00:03:29,000
始まったよ！始まったよ！
It's started! It's started!

4
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:32,000
イエーーイ！
Yay!

5
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:41,500
本日何をするのかと言うと、ホロライブ夏祭りです！
As for what we're doing today, it's the Hololive Summer Festival!

6
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:44,000
ということで！イエーーイ！
And with that... Yay!

7
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:47,800
それではまず、お店屋さんの紹介をしていきたいと思います！
So first off, I'd like to introduce our festival stalls!

8
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:49,200
店屋さん？
Stalls?

9
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:52,800
まずは、えー、レックウザ生存確認よし！
First up, um, Rayquaza vitals confirmed, good!

10
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,300
あ、レックウザきた！
Ah, Rayquaza's here!

11
00:03:55,300 --> 00:03:56,500
レックウザ！
Rayquaza!

12
00:03:56,500 --> 00:03:59,800
これはハコス流の流しそうめん屋さんです！
This is the Hakos-style flowing somen noodle shop!

13
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:03,200
いらっしゃい、らっしゃい！いらっしゃい！
Welcome, welcome! Welcome!

14
00:04:03,500 --> 00:04:07,500
いらっしゃい、らっしゃい！流しそうめん準備しておりますた！
Welcome, welcome! The flowing somen is all ready to go!

15
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:12,000
ナイス！今日はね、ハコスがね、もう大量のそうめんをね、一人で茹でてきてくれたんだよね？
Nice! Today, Hakos boiled a whole bunch of noodles all by herself, right?

16
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:14,800
すごーい！イエーイ！
Amazing! Woohoo!

17
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,200
はい、そうめん食べたい方はこちら！
Yep, whoever wants somen, come right here!

18
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:20,500
そして、ヨーヨー屋さんもあります！ヨーヨー屋さんですか？
And we also have a yo-yo stall! How's the yo-yo shop?

19
00:04:20,500 --> 00:04:24,000
はーい！白上フブキです！ヨーヨーあります！
Yes! Shirakami Fubuki here! We have yo-yos!

20
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:28,000
はい、ということでヨーヨーしたい方は白上ちゃんに声をかけてください！
Alright, so if you want to play with yo-yos, just ask Shirakami-chan!

21
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:31,000
そして！今スバルのわたあめ屋さんとなってるんですけど...
And! Right now it says "Subaru's Cotton Candy Shop," but...

22
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,700
今日わたあめ屋さんをしてくれるのはこの人！
the person running the cotton candy shop today is this one!

23
00:04:33,700 --> 00:04:37,000
はーい！うちうち、うちだよ！大神ミオだよ！
Yes! Me, me, it's me! Ookami Mio here!

24
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,500
初めてわたあめ作るけど大丈夫かな？
It's my first time making cotton candy, but hope it turns out okay!

25
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:41,800
よろしくお願いしまーす！
Looking forward to having fun with everyone!

26
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,700
イエーイ！やったー！
Yay! Woohoo!

27
00:04:43,700 --> 00:04:47,000
そしてですね、他にもですね、食べ物がたくさん、たこ焼きとか焼きそばとかね、
Also, we have tons of other food, like takoyaki and yakisoba,

28
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:50,500
りんご飴とかあるんで好きに食べてくださーい！わーい！
and candy apples, so please eat whatever you like! Yay!

29
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:54,000
そして、今テーブルにいるメンバーまず紹介します！まずは、カリ！
Next, let me introduce the members at the table right now! First is Calli!

30
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:57,000
はーい、みなさん、森カリオペです！
Hi everyone, it's Mori Calliope!

31
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:00,000
よろしくお願いしまーす！やったー、夏大好き！
Great to be here! Yay, I love summer!

32
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,800
イエーイ！
Yay!

33
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:04,000
どんどん回す！そして、アイリス！
Keeping it rolling! Next is IRyS!

34
00:05:04,008 --> 00:05:09,408
Hi! Hi, darlings! Hololive English -Advent-'s ravenous diva, the one and only Nerissa Ravencroftだよ！
Hi! Hi, darlings! Hololive English -Advent-'s ravenous diva, the one and only Nerissa Ravencroft dayo!

35
00:05:09,408 --> 00:05:12,008
イエーイ！
Yay!

36
00:05:12,008 --> 00:05:14,508
ビブーだー！
It's Biboo!

37
00:05:15,008 --> 00:05:16,308
誰から行く？
Who's going first?

38
00:05:16,308 --> 00:05:17,308
What's up?

39
00:05:17,308 --> 00:05:19,908
ビ・ブ・ー！
Bi-boo!

40
00:05:19,908 --> 00:05:21,808
ビブーでーす！
It's Biboo!

41
00:05:21,808 --> 00:05:24,508
イエーイ！
Yay!

42
00:05:24,508 --> 00:05:27,008
ということで、えー、こんな感じでね。
So with that, this is how we're doing it.

43
00:05:27,008 --> 00:05:31,208
あとね、あの全体見る担当の大空スバルです！よろしくお願いしまーす！
And I'm Oozora Subaru, in charge of overlooking everything! Great to be here!

44
00:05:31,208 --> 00:05:33,808
イエーイ！
Yay!

45
00:05:33,808 --> 00:05:36,808
はい！それでは好きに楽しんでください！どうぞー！
All right! Please enjoy yourselves however you like! Go ahead!

46
00:05:36,808 --> 00:05:38,508
どうぞー！
Go ahead!

47
00:05:38,508 --> 00:05:42,208
ヨーヨー屋さんやってこ！
Let's check out the yo-yo booth!

48
00:05:42,208 --> 00:05:44,808
えっと、わたあめ何色？
Um, what color cotton candy?

49
00:05:44,808 --> 00:05:47,008
何色にします？
What color would you like?

50
00:05:47,008 --> 00:05:49,508
紫？オッケー！
Purple? Okay!

51
00:05:49,508 --> 00:05:52,508
自分でやってみたいよね
You wanna try doing it yourself, right?

52
00:05:52,508 --> 00:05:57,008
わちゃわちゃするんですけど、あの夏のわちゃわちゃを楽しんでください！
It's gonna be chaotic, but please enjoy the summer festival chaos!

53
00:05:57,008 --> 00:05:58,508
はーい！
Okay!

54
00:05:58,508 --> 00:06:01,208
釣ったことないからな
I've never fished for them before.

55
00:06:01,208 --> 00:06:03,008
ヨーヨー取るぞー！
Let's catch a yo-yo balloon!

56
00:06:03,008 --> 00:06:06,008
何か、魚みたいのいる！
There's something like a fish in there!

57
00:06:06,008 --> 00:06:10,008
魚？この子？この魚、光るやつなんだ！
A fish? This one? This fish is one that glows!

58
00:06:10,008 --> 00:06:12,508
惜しい！
So close!

59
00:06:12,508 --> 00:06:15,208
あと6秒しかない！
Only 6 seconds left!

60
00:06:15,208 --> 00:06:17,508
いけるいける！ああ、見えない！
You can do it, you can do it! Ah, I can't see!

61
00:06:17,508 --> 00:06:20,208
あー、取れた！取れたー！
Ah, caught it! She caught it!

62
00:06:20,208 --> 00:06:23,008
やったー！
Yay!

63
00:06:23,008 --> 00:06:25,508
そうめん流すぞー！
Flowing the somen!

64
00:06:25,508 --> 00:06:28,008
Calliが汁こぼしてて草
Calli spilled the dipping sauce, lol.

65
00:06:28,008 --> 00:06:29,808
I'm so sorry!

66
00:06:29,808 --> 00:06:32,008
大丈夫、大丈夫！
It's okay, it's okay!

67
00:06:32,008 --> 00:06:34,508
大丈夫だって！
It's totally fine!

68
00:06:34,508 --> 00:06:37,008
大丈夫！何とかなる！
It's alright! We'll make it work!

69
00:06:37,008 --> 00:06:39,808
水わーい！
Yay for water!

70
00:06:39,808 --> 00:06:43,508
ここから水びたしになるから...
It's gonna be flooded from here...

71
00:06:43,508 --> 00:06:46,008
ありがとう！
Thank you!

72
00:06:46,008 --> 00:06:48,208
ナイスキャッチ！
Nice catch!

73
00:06:48,208 --> 00:06:52,808
これさ、これないと紙のこよりがもらえないんだよ！
Look, without this, you don't get the paper string!

74
00:06:52,808 --> 00:06:56,508
フブキ先輩、優しくしてくださいよ！
Fubuki-senpai, please go easy on us!

75
00:06:56,508 --> 00:06:59,208
一回一個あげよう、これ！一個！
Let's give them one each! Just one!

76
00:06:59,208 --> 00:07:03,008
いい、大丈夫！好きなの一個！好きなの！
Yeah, it's fine! Pick one you like! Whichever!

77
00:07:03,008 --> 00:07:05,808
いいの？どれにする？
Really? Which one do you want?

78
00:07:05,808 --> 00:07:10,508
すいちゃんが絶対緑、水色選ぶから水色！
Sui-chan would definitely pick green or light blue, so light blue!

79
00:07:10,508 --> 00:07:14,008
これ？じゃあ、もらいます！
This one? Then we'll take it!

80
00:07:14,008 --> 00:07:16,508
釣れたー！
Caught it!

81
00:07:16,508 --> 00:07:18,508
釣れたよー！
We caught it!

82
00:07:18,508 --> 00:07:22,508
それもらうじゃん！
You're just taking it!

83
00:07:22,508 --> 00:07:26,008
釣れました！
Caught it!

84
00:07:26,008 --> 00:07:28,008
どうですか？
How is it?

85
00:07:28,008 --> 00:07:32,008
この見えない糸みたいなのが出てくるからね！
These invisible string-like strands will start coming out!

86
00:07:32,008 --> 00:07:34,808
見えない糸？！
Invisible strings?!

87
00:07:34,808 --> 00:07:39,008
マジで、こうやって... あ、ほら！
Seriously, just like this... Ah, look!

88
00:07:39,008 --> 00:07:41,508
かわいい！イエーイ！
So cute! Yay!

89
00:07:41,508 --> 00:07:44,508
イエーイ！
Yay!

90
00:07:44,508 --> 00:07:48,208
流すよ！来た来た！
Flowing it down! Here it comes, here it comes!

91
00:07:48,208 --> 00:07:53,008
誰もキャッチできてないから！
Nobody is catching any of it!

92
00:07:53,008 --> 00:07:57,008
キャッチ！取れた取れた！
Catch! Caught it, caught it!

93
00:07:57,008 --> 00:08:00,508
違う違う！濃い濃い！
No no! It's too concentrated!

94
00:08:00,508 --> 00:08:03,508
あったかいよ、この辺！
It's warm around here!

95
00:08:03,508 --> 00:08:06,008
わたあめできてる？
Is the cotton candy forming?

96
00:08:06,008 --> 00:08:09,508
ギャー！溶けてない！
Gyaa! It hasn't melted!

97
00:08:09,508 --> 00:08:13,508
テストでは... テスト、テストではできてたの！テストでは！
In the test... During the test it was working! In the test!

98
00:08:13,508 --> 00:08:18,008
あったかくなるまで時間かかるかも！
It might take some time to heat up!

99
00:08:18,008 --> 00:08:21,508
ナイス！ナイス！
Nice! Nice!

100
00:08:21,508 --> 00:08:26,008
え、これお砂糖入れてから回すんでいいんだよね？
Wait, you turn it on after putting the sugar in, right?

101
00:08:26,008 --> 00:08:28,208
そう！回す！
Right! Spin it!

102
00:08:28,208 --> 00:08:31,508
あっ、怖い怖いです！
Ah, it's scary, it's scary!

103
00:08:31,508 --> 00:08:34,508
まだ溶けてないんだ...
It hasn't melted yet...

104
00:08:34,508 --> 00:08:37,008
キャー！もう一回！
Kyaa! One more time!

105
00:08:37,008 --> 00:08:39,808
何か白いのが出てきた！
Some white stuff came out!

106
00:08:39,808 --> 00:08:42,508
OK, OK. ありがとうございます！
OK, OK. Thank you so much!

107
00:08:42,508 --> 00:08:46,008
ナイスー！
Nice!

108
00:08:46,008 --> 00:08:49,008
マジで？オレンジ欲しい！
Seriously? I want orange!

109
00:08:49,008 --> 00:08:54,008
流れてきた！うわー！
It's flowing down! Whoa!

110
00:08:54,008 --> 00:08:58,008
行け行け！手で！
Go, go! Use your hand!

111
00:08:58,008 --> 00:09:02,508
頑張れ、頑張れ！来た来た！
Hang in there, you got this! Here it comes, here it comes!

112
00:09:02,508 --> 00:09:06,508
いいよいいよ！惜しい！
Looking good, looking good! So close!

113
00:09:06,508 --> 00:09:11,508
頑張れ！落ちてる、落ちてるよ！
Hang in there! It's falling, it's falling!

114
00:09:11,508 --> 00:09:16,508
マジで？！おかわりー！
Seriously?! Refill, please!

115
00:09:16,508 --> 00:09:20,008
じゃ、いきます！
All right, here goes!

116
00:09:20,008 --> 00:09:22,508
お前邪魔なんだよ！
You're in the way!

117
00:09:22,508 --> 00:09:25,508
出てきた！
It came out!

118
00:09:25,508 --> 00:09:30,508
やめて！やめてやめて！
Stop! Stop, stop it!

119
00:09:30,508 --> 00:09:35,508
めっちゃ飛んできた！やばい！
It flew everywhere! Oh no!

120
00:09:35,508 --> 00:09:40,008
何か下手くそ神降臨した！
Looks like the God of Clumsiness has descended!

121
00:09:40,008 --> 00:09:44,508
わたあめが...
The cotton candy...

122
00:09:44,508 --> 00:09:48,508
わたあめ壊れてるんじゃないですか？やめて！
Isn't the cotton candy machine broken? Stop it!

123
00:09:48,508 --> 00:09:53,008
次ネリッサ！ネリッサ！ネリッサは好きなのどうぞ！
Next is Nerissa! Nerissa! Nerissa, pick whatever you like!

124
00:09:53,008 --> 00:09:57,008
怖いですね...
This is scary...

125
00:09:57,008 --> 00:10:01,508
いけるいける！大丈夫！
You can do it! It's okay!

126
00:10:02,956 --> 00:15:01,911
Error processing subtitles for this segment.

127
00:15:02,111 --> 00:15:03,211
うまい、うまい
Nice, nice!

128
00:15:03,211 --> 00:15:04,311
あ、うまい！
Oh, nice!

129
00:15:04,311 --> 00:15:06,011
よーし！さすがマリン船長！
All right! As expected of Captain Marine!

130
00:15:06,011 --> 00:15:07,711
船長、これ取れる？マリン船長！
Captain, can you get this one? Captain Marine!

131
00:15:07,711 --> 00:15:09,311
取れるんじゃなーい？
Should be able to, right?

132
00:15:09,311 --> 00:15:11,211
取れるんじゃない？
I think I can!

133
00:15:11,211 --> 00:15:13,311
流しそうめんより簡単！
This is easier than flowing somen!

134
00:15:13,311 --> 00:15:15,711
あれ？
Huh?

135
00:15:15,711 --> 00:15:18,711
沈む方がやばいって！
Sinking it makes it even worse!

136
00:15:18,711 --> 00:15:21,311
ビビにする？
Go for Bibi?

137
00:15:21,311 --> 00:15:23,311
まだいける、まだいける！
You can still do it, still do it!

138
00:15:23,311 --> 00:15:25,311
頑張れ、頑張れ！
Go for it, go for it!

139
00:15:25,311 --> 00:15:27,411
どっちか選んでください
Please choose one.

140
00:15:27,411 --> 00:15:29,311
落ちます！マリン、どっちにする？
It's falling! Marine, which one?

141
00:15:29,311 --> 00:15:31,411
紫にする？
Go for purple?

142
00:15:31,411 --> 00:15:33,111
うわっ！
Whoa!

143
00:15:33,111 --> 00:15:35,311
マリン、どうする？
Marine, what are you gonna do?

144
00:15:35,311 --> 00:15:37,211
待ってよ、ほら！
Wait, look!

145
00:15:37,211 --> 00:15:39,311
待ってよ、それ！
Wait a sec for that!

146
00:15:39,311 --> 00:15:41,311
あ、入った、入った！
Ah, it went in, it went in!

147
00:15:41,311 --> 00:15:42,711
あ、うま！
Oh, nice!

148
00:15:42,711 --> 00:15:44,411
あ、うまい！
Oh, well done!

149
00:15:44,411 --> 00:15:46,611
なんかちょっとやだ…
I kind of hate this...

150
00:15:46,611 --> 00:15:48,611
なんで？いい感じじゃん！
Why? It looks great!

151
00:15:48,611 --> 00:15:50,411
なんか三角やで
It's kind of triangular.

152
00:15:50,411 --> 00:15:52,611
船長、これいいじゃん！全然！
Captain, isn't this fine? / Not at all!

153
00:15:52,611 --> 00:15:54,811
船長、頑張れ！頑張れ！
Captain, do your best! Hang in there!

154
00:15:54,811 --> 00:15:57,111
ギリギリまでいける！
You can take it right to the limit!

155
00:15:57,111 --> 00:15:59,111
無理？でもいい！
Impossible? But it's fine!

156
00:15:59,111 --> 00:16:01,711
無理、無理、無理！
No way, no way, no way!

157
00:16:01,711 --> 00:16:05,111
切れた！あーーー！
It snapped! Aaaah!

158
00:16:05,111 --> 00:16:07,711
残念！何個取れたの？
Too bad! How many did you get?

159
00:16:07,711 --> 00:16:10,411
0個だよ！
Zero!

160
00:16:10,411 --> 00:16:13,611
手で持った方が…
Holding it with your hands...

161
00:16:13,611 --> 00:16:16,211
両手で持った方がいい！
You should hold it with both hands!

162
00:16:16,211 --> 00:16:18,311
スバルの！
Subaru's!

163
00:16:18,311 --> 00:16:21,311
おいおい、誰がこの町内会のセッティングやったんだ！
Hey hey, who set up this neighborhood festival?!

164
00:16:21,311 --> 00:16:22,911
すいません、ごめんなさい！
Sorry, I'm so sorry!

165
00:16:22,911 --> 00:16:25,711
おいおい！
Hey hey!

166
00:16:25,711 --> 00:16:28,411
えー？どうする？
Eh? What should we do?

167
00:16:28,411 --> 00:16:31,511
