1412
01:10:37,966 --> 01:10:39,266
I would.

1413
01:10:39,266 --> 01:10:41,966
夏祭りの思い出！
Summer festival memories!

1414
01:10:41,966 --> 01:10:44,466
オッケー、うーんと...
Okay, umm...

1415
01:10:47,466 --> 01:10:49,266
That's for Mococo-chan and the...

1416
01:10:49,266 --> 01:10:51,466
夏祭りの思い出出して！
Share a summer festival memory!

1417
01:10:51,466 --> 01:10:53,966
仕上げ、キラキラ...
The finishing touch, sparkle...

1418
01:10:53,966 --> 01:10:55,666
それ最近じゃん！
That was just recently!

1419
01:10:55,666 --> 01:10:57,666
I skipped a step, so... okay.

1420
01:10:57,666 --> 01:11:00,466
もっとキラキラ！バーン！
More sparkle! Baaam!

1421
01:11:00,466 --> 01:11:02,466
え？え？
Eh? Eh?

1422
