Yay!

1465
01:13:04,966 --> 01:13:07,966
Okay, one more! ワンモア！
Okay, one more! One more!

1466
01:13:07,966 --> 01:13:10,466
ワンモア！ラストワン！最後！
One more! Last one! Last one!

1467
01:13:10,466 --> 01:13:12,966
最後！オッケー！
Last one! Okay!

1468
01:13:12,966 --> 01:13:14,966
ワンモア！
One more!

1469
01:13:14,966 --> 01:13:16,966
緑がいいな！青い壁！
Green would be nice! A blue wall!

1470
01:13:16,966 --> 01:13:18,466
Oh, really?

1471
01:13:18,466 --> 01:13:20,466
Yeah, it's like separate 10 minutes...

1472
01:13:20,466 --> 01:13:22,466
お待たせしました！どうぞ！
Sorry to keep you waiting! Here you go!

1473
01:13:22,966 --> 01:13:24,466
おー！
Ooh!

1474
01:13:24,466 --> 01:13:25,966
Here we go!

1475
01:13:25,966 --> 01:13:28,466
全然取れてない！
You didn't get any at all!

1476
01:13:28,466 --> 01:13:30,466
手前を汚し...
Making a mess on this side...

1477
01:13:30,466 --> 01:13:33,466
また逃したのか！
Did you miss it again?!

1478
01:13:33,466 --> 01:13:37,466
そうめんこれだけやってさ、次のそうめんが流れてきたんだけど！
We barely touched this somen, and the next one is already flowing!

1479
01:13:37,466 --> 01:13:39,466
美味しそう！
Looks good!

1480
01:13:39,466 --> 01:13:41,466
そう！
Yeah!

1481
01:13:41,466 --> 01:13:44,466
ホワイトソースの粉が...
The white sauce powder...

1482
01:13:44,466 --> 01:13:46,466
取れない！
Can't get it!

1483
01:13:46,466 --> 01:13:48,466
大丈夫だよ！
It's alright!

1484
01:13:48,466 --> 01:13:50,466
そうめん！そうめん！
Somen! Somen!

1485
01:13:50,466 --> 01:13:52,966
そうめん食べた！
Ate the somen!

1486
01:13:52,966 --> 01:13:55,466
おい！お前ふざけんなよ！
Hey! Don't mess with me!

1487
01:13:55,466 --> 01:13:57,466
遅れアシストでさ...
With the delayed assist...

1488
01:13:57,466 --> 01:13:59,466
I didn't do it!

1489
01:13:59,466 --> 01:14:02,466
えー！そうめん泥棒いる！？
Wait! Is there a somen thief?!

1490
01:14:02,466 --> 01:14:05,966
