Because a big event is about to happen!

1504
01:14:39,966 --> 01:14:42,466
想像通り良い匂いだよ！
It smells as good as expected!

1505
01:14:42,466 --> 01:14:44,466
ね、賞品持ってきたよ！
Hey, I brought the prizes!

1506
01:14:44,466 --> 01:14:45,966
ん？え？
Hm? Eh?

1507
01:14:45,966 --> 01:14:47,966
チョコレートソース！
Chocolate sauce!

1508
01:14:47,966 --> 01:14:49,466
何？何の賞品？
What? A prize for what?

1509
01:14:49,466 --> 01:14:52,466
いや、あー！
No, aaah!

1510
01:14:52,466 --> 01:14:55,966
こっちでも用意してあったけど、みこちのもあるってことね！
We prepared some here too, but you mean Mikochi brought some too!

1511
01:14:55,966 --> 01:14:57,466
うん！
Yup!

1512
01:14:57,466 --> 01:14:59,966
え？何？みこちの賞品？
Eh? What? Mikochi's prize?

1513
01:15:00,466 --> 01:15:03,466
光ってる方から先渡すね！
I'll hand over the glowing one first!

1514
01:15:03,466 --> 01:15:04,866
